1.FIRST REPEATED CHARACTER 
Given a string s. The task is to find the first repeated character in it. We need to find the character that occurs more than once and whose index of second occurrence is smallest. s contains only lowercase letters.
SOURCE CODE : 
        class Solution {
            String firstRepChar(String s) {
                boolean[] seen=new boolean[26];
                for(char c:s.toCharArray()){
                    if(seen[c-'a']){
                        return String.valueOf(c);
                    }
                    seen[c-'a']=true;
                }
                return "-1";
            }
        }
PROBLEM LINK : https://www.geeksforgeeks.org/problems/find-first-repeated-character4108/1


2.NON REPEATING CHARACTER 
Given a string s consisting of lowercase English Letters. return the first non-repeating character in s. If there is no non-repeating character, return '$'.
SOURCE CODE : 
        class Solution {
            public char nonRepeatingChar(String s) {
                // code here
                int[] freq=new int[256];
                for(char c:s.toCharArray()){
                    freq[c]++;
                }
                for(char c:s.toCharArray()){
                    if(freq[c]==1){
                        return c;
                    }
                }
                return '$';
            }
        }
PROBLEM LINK : https://www.geeksforgeeks.org/problems/non-repeating-character-1587115620/1


3.PALINDROME STRING 
Given a string s, return true if the string is a palindrome. Otherwise, return false.
A string is considered a palindrome if it reads the same forwards and backwards.
SOURCE CODE : 
        class Solution {
            boolean isPalindrome(String s) {
                // code here
                char ch[]=s.toCharArray();
                for(int i=0;i<s.length();i++){
                    int j=s.length()-i-1;
                    if(ch[i]!=ch[j]){
                        return false;
                    }
                }
                return true;
            }
        }
PROBLEM LINK : https://www.geeksforgeeks.org/problems/palindrome-string0817/1
